indicators.title:
Extent that measures developed/implemented with UN's support are in place to advance women and girl's leadership and equal participation in decision-making in: 
a) Public institutions; 
b) Elected positions, including parliaments and local governments; 
c) Judiciary; 
d) Private sector; 
e) Mediation, reconciliation and peacebuilding mechanisms; and
f) Natural resource management

